data: {"id": "e6a12c27b0a74469-thinking-layer-420", "run_id": "e6a12c27b0a74469", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Pod `workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r` 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。根据标签 `aiops.lab/case-id=c10` 和状态，这符合 `CrashLoopBackOffRuntime` 的特征（需要排除 OOMKilled 和 ImagePull/Config 等明确原因后归类，或者作为通用 CrashLoopBackOff 处理）。\n\n根据提供的 Runbook 列表：\n- `pod-oomkilled.md`: 需要 Last State Reason=OOMKilled。目前仅知 CrashLoopBackOff，未确认是否 OOM。\n- `pod-imagepull-failed.md`: 状态为 ImagePullBackOff/ErrImagePull，不符。\n- `pod-config-error.md`: 状态为 CreateContainerConfigError，不符。\n- `pod-crashloop-runtime.md`: 适用于 STATUS=CrashLoopBackOff 且没有已确认的 OOMKil", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789353992988}

