data: {"id": "e6a12c27b0a74469-thinking-parallel_evidence-1698", "run_id": "e6a12c27b0a74469", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的事实，分析如下：\n\n**支持事实：**\n- **当前状态确认**：Pod `workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r` 状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`，就绪 `0/1`，重启 `9 (3m2s ago)`。\n- **崩溃原因明确**：`kubectl_describe` 显示容器退出码 **Exit Code: 137**。在 Linux 中，137 等于 `SIGKILL` (128 + 9)，代表进程收到了强制终止信号。\n- **Liveness Probe 异常**：Event 显示 **17m 前**存在 8 次 Liveness Probe 失败 (`statuscode: 500`)。这表明在崩溃发生前的运行期间，服务曾出现后端业务逻辑错误。\n- **Liveness 触发了 Killing**：Event 记录 \"Container app failed liveness probe, will be restarted\"。\n\n**冲突事实：**\n- **Crash 窗口内日志缺失**：`kubectl_previous_logs` (", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789354079278, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

