``text\n内存限制过低 (96Mi, fact-1) → 容器运行触发 OOMKill → Pod 退出码 137 (fact-4) → 导致 Liveness 失败 (fact-3) 及 CrashLoopBackOff (fact-5)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**容器资源限制配置不足引发 OOMKill**。\n\n证据明确指向：\n1.  Pod `workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r` 中 `app` 容器被配置了极低的内存硬限制 `96Mi`（证据 1）。\n2.  容器最后终止原因为 `Error`（证据 6），退出码为 `137`（证据 4），这是 Linux 内核触发 OOMKill 的标志。\n3.  由此导致的 OOM 使得容器无法通过 Liveness Probe（返回 500，证据 3），触发 kubelet 的 BackOff 重启机制（证据 2），最终表现为持续的 CrashLoopBackOff（证据 7）。\n4.  监控日志显示应用业务请求可成功返回 200（证据 8、9），证明应用无代码缺陷，资源不足是唯一的触发点。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 25.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 74.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r: 74.7s (Evidence 69.5s, RCA 5.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 114.301, "metrics": {"run_id": "e6a12c27b0a74469", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 114.30787444114685, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_mat